# Cathode Flats: the Dumps, track 3 (SPEC 3.2). Wide and fast over the
# flattened CRT glass: a big M round the landfill with long straights,
# and no walls where the flats break into pits (open edges: leave the
# road and you drop in, SEGMENT FAULT). The start straight is open on
# both sides; the east side and the M's notch are open on the inside; the
# Sweeper crosses the east side below the pit edge; the
# bottom straight jumps a pit off a ramp. A service bay on the right lane
# of the west side.
# Control point 0 is the start line; features on point i apply to the
# segment from point i to i+1; a segment without `open` has walls.
league dumps
width 66
# x    y    half   features
 290  130   70     open            # start line: the flats, pits both sides
 560  125   70     crates          # top straight: four crates
 800  150   68
 895  300   66     open:right      # east side: the pit on the inside
 885  560   66     sweeper         # east side south: the Sweeper crosses
 870  790   66
 720  885   68     ramp            # bottom straight west: the ramp over a pit
 580  870   66
 550  700   62     crates          # up into the M's notch
 535  480   60     open:left       # the notch's inside drops into a pit
 485  370   60
 385  360   60
 340  470   62
 330  690   64
 315  825   64
 225  895   66
 135  825   66
 120  700   66     bay:right       # west side north: the service bay lane
 120  480   66     crates          # west side: three crates
 130  300   68
 180  170   70
